      "provenance": {
        "notes": "Sold as 'Silver Falls'. Watering: NC State dry to medium moisture, very drought tolerant; RHS well-drained and drought resistant; mapped to let_top_dry (agent). Hardiness: NC State zones 10a to 12b, RHS H2: tender, move frost-free for winter. Size: NC State 2 to 4 in by 3 to 4 ft, RHS up to 10 cm by 1 to 1.5 m. Toxicity: only NC State says anything, and only about people (low severity, skin irritation from touching, contact dermatitis yes); nothing was found on cats or dogs, so no pet lines are stored and pet safety is unknown (the starter list's 'non-toxic' is knowledge, unverified). RHS is silent."
      },
